commit 3d0a5e5eaed63ddf1f75fbd852fbd38b1c0be149
Author: Samuel He <samuelhe52@outlook.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 19 23:58:05 2026 +0800

    perf: Read the topology epoch without the state lock in delivery
    
    The replication delivery loop took the NodeState read lock before every
    RPC attempt only to compare the topology epoch. Mirror the epoch in an
    atomic that set_topology keeps current and read that instead.

